# CMDEDIT-PAINT-05: Three instances, two overlapping the box; erase subcell.
# Hefesto script (hefesto-cli --diagnostics=magic): the same commands.
tech load input/tiny -noprompt
load a
load leaf
box 0 0 10 10
paint metal1
save leaf
load top
box 0 0 0 0
getcell leaf
box 20 0 20 0
getcell leaf
box 40 0 40 0
getcell leaf
box 5 5 25 15
erase subcell
save top
